OL,3,GNEWSAReduced travel support proposed   
OL,4,Afor post-16s                           
OL,6,FProposed changes to assisted travel for
OL,7,Fyoung people have been presented to a  
OL,8,Fcouncil.                               
OL,10,FCurrently, 92 young people across South
OL,11,FTyneside receive help getting to       
OL,12,Fschool, college or training. A         
OL,13,Fcouncil-funded service provides taxis  
OL,14,For mini-buses, or can offer a personal 
OL,15,Ftravel budget which subsidises 45p per 
OL,16,Fmile covered.                          
OL,18,FThe changes would make the criteria to 
OL,19,Faccessing these stricter. An assessment
OL,20,Fwould see whether young people can     
OL,21,Ftravel by themselves, and the personal 
OL,22,Ftravel budget would be restricted.     
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
